        <mxCell id="cots_controls" parent="ns_cots" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFCDD2;strokeColor=#C62828;fontSize=10;size=15;" value="4 Compensating Controls:&#xa;1. CiliumNetworkPolicy — isolated namespace&#xa;   (ingress: backend→TCP/8443 only)&#xa;   (egress: egress-proxy→TCP/443 only)&#xa;2. Falco — COTS-specific rules:&#xa;   P1: shell spawn, /etc/shadow read&#xa;   P2: unexpected network connection&#xa;3. Kyverno — no RBAC modification&#xa;   image by digest only in this NS&#xa;4. Weekly Trivy scan + auto-ticket&#xa;   on new Critical CVE" vertex="1">
